## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to handle multi-tenant token flows with dynamic metadata sources and replay protection, a common real-world requirement.

## Key Concepts
- OIDC/SAML validation paths, JWKS/SAML metadata fetch with caching
- Per-tenant audience checks and nonce-based replay protection
